Emo|No, nothing at all|
Proog|And at your right,|
|What do you see at your right side, Emo?|
Emo|The same Proog, exactly the same|
|Nothing!|noda
Proog|Great|

Scene 6: Which way
Emo|Listen Proog! Do you hear that! Can we go here?|
Proog|There..? It isn't safe, Emo|
Emo|But|
Proog|Trust me, it's not|
Emo|Maybe I could go...|
Proog|No|
Emo|But|
Proog|NO|
Emo|It|
Proog|NO|
Proog|Any further questions?|
Emo|No.|

Scene 7:Emo flips out
Proog|Emo|
Emo|Yeah?|
Proog|Emo, why?|
|Emo, why, why can't you see the beauty of this place?|
|The way it works... how- how perfect it is|
Emo|No, Proog, I don't see!|
|I don't see because there's nothing there!|
|And why should I trust my life to something that isn't there?|
|Can you tell me that?|
Proog|Emo|
Emo|Answer me!!|

